---
const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Head from "../../components/Head.astro";
import Logo from "../../images/52Cards.png"

import PaymentForm from "../../components/PaymentForm.astro";

import "../../styles/project.css"
---

<BaseLayout renderHome={true}>
    <Head slot="head"
        title="Krystal - 52Cards"
        description="52Cards is an upcoming desktop game where you get to play 52
            different card games against multiple CPU opponents. It is currently being 
            ported to the web so you can see and play our progress for yourself."
        keywords="52cards, 52 cards, krystal 52cards, krystal 52 cards, krystal card games"
    />

    <main>
        <section>
            <h1>52Cards</h1>
            <img id="logo" src={Logo.src} alt="Saturn's logo"/>

            <div id="status-bar">
                <p>Status: Ongoing development</p>
                <p id="middle">Version: N/A</p>
                <p>License: Unlicensed</p>
            </div>
            
            <p>
                52Cards is an upcoming desktop game that comes with 52 card games bundled together.
                We are working hard to port some of the games that we have created onto this website
                so you can play them too, for free. Proudly developed in 
                <a href="https://godotengine.org">Godot</a> and models made using 
                <a href="https://blender.org">Blender</a>.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h1>Credits</h1>
            <p><strong>Game Developer:</strong> Oliver Lie</p>
            <p><strong>Play Testers:</strong> Mutian Gao, Oliver Lie</p>
            <p><strong>3D Artists:</strong> Oliver Lie</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h1>Support the Development</h1>
            <p>Here are some ways you can support the development of 52Cards:</p>

            <h2>1. Suggest a game</h2>
            <p>
                Suggesting a card game is a great way to support the development!
                It gives us ideas, feedback, and shows interest in the project.
                If you're going to suggest a card game, please tell us the name,
                the rules, how to play it, and any other resources we can use as a
                reference.
            </p>

            <h2>2. Play a Game on our Website</h2>
            <p>
                Playing a game we've built on our website would help us immensely. 
                Our play testing can't account for and find every single bug, so 
                the more people trying out our games, the more bugs we can find and fix.
            </p>

            <h2>3. Financial Support</h2>
            <p>
                Financial support would be such a huge help. With it, we can hire more 
                developers and artists to make 52Cards the best we can. It also 
                shows interest and investment, and tells us how much time we need 
                to dedicate to exceed your expectations.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h1>Games in Progress of Porting:</h1>
            <ul>
                <li>Slapjack</li>
                <li>Egyptian Rat Screw</li>
                <li>Solitaire</li>
                <li>Speed</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <input id="show-form" type="checkbox"/>
            <label for="show-form">Click to Support</label>
            <span>
                <PaymentForm reason="Saturn"/>
            </span>
        </section>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;

    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    border-radius: 25px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), 0 6px 20px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.19);

    margin: 4% 0 0 10%;
    padding-bottom: 2.5%;
    width: 80%;
    height: fit-content;
    background: transparent;
    margin-bottom: 2svh;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

#logo {
   filter: var(--image--brightness);
   max-width: 30%;
}

#status-bar {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto auto auto;

    width: 90%;
    margin: 5% 5% 5% 5%;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--card-border-color);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--card-border-color);
}

#middle {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--card-border-color);
    border-right: 3px solid var(--card-border-color);
}

p {
    max-width: 80%;
}

code {
    text-align: left;
    width: 75%;
    color: #9ECBFF;
    background-color: #24292e;
}

span {
    color: #B392F0;
}

label~span {
    width: 100%;
}

#show-form, label~span {
    display: none;
}

#show-from, #show-form~label {
    align-self: center;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 3svh;
}

#show-form~label {
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--text-color);
}

#show-form:checked~span {
    display: block;
}

ul {
    width: 75%;
}

li {
    text-align: left;
}

@media (orientation: landscape) {
    main {
        margin-left: calc(env(safe-area-inset-left));
    }
}
</style>
